207F   53 6F 72 63 65 72 65 72 00 DB   "Sorcerer",0   
2088   F2 2B                  DW   SETGAME   
208A   53 70 65 6C 6C 62 72 65 61 6B 65 72 00 DB   "Spellbreaker",0   
